WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:11.250
The Pokémon are
really staying here as guests.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.416
As you can see,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.041
people and Pokémon can enjoy
the resort together or on their own.

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:25.458
We also have Pokémon on staff.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:26.416
And sometimes…

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.166
A Wooper?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.083
There are also wild Pokémon who call
the resort home. This Wooper, for example.

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:36.083
Around here, our motto is "Pokémon First."

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:41.333
And so, our job

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.416
is to take care of these Pokémon
and ensure they enjoy the resort.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:48.083
In other words,
you'll be the Pokémon concierge.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:49.583
A concierge, huh?

